# Template of .env (#337): copy it to .env in the root of the checkout that runs compose
# (the release checkout for the scheduler) and fill in the values there. .env stays out of
# Git (.gitignore); compose reads it with env_file. This file holds keys and comments only.
# Do not set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN: news-llm and candidate-notes refuse to
# run with either (they use the subscription only).

# Claude Code subscription token for claude -p in the containers. Run `claude setup-token` on a
# local machine with a browser (not over SSH or in a container) and paste the token it prints.
# Valid for one year; write its expiry date here: YYYY-MM-DD.
# Empty or expired: claude -p fails authentication, the news and candidate notes stay
# pending, and the watchdog comments on #1 (docs/OPERATIONS.md section 6.1).
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# GitHub fine-grained PAT for gh in the containers, repository YiCheng0608/stock-lab only:
# Issues read and write; Pull requests, Actions and Metadata read-only.
# Write its expiry date here: YYYY-MM-DD.
# Empty or expired: the watchdog cannot comment on #1; it logs gh_auth_failed every run and
# comments once gh is accepted again.
GH_TOKEN=
# The backend image sets TZ=Asia/Taipei and STOCK_DATA_DIR=/data (the stock-data volume).
# Uncomment only to change them; an empty TZ= is UTC, so never leave either line empty.
# TZ=Asia/Taipei
# STOCK_DATA_DIR=/data

# Optional overrides for running the backend or frontend directly on this machine (no Docker).
# Not for the compose .env: a Windows path here would reach the containers and break them.
# STOCK_DB_PATH=C:/absolute/path/to/data/stock.db
# STOCK_DATA_DIR=C:/absolute/path/to/data
# STOCK_RAW_DIR=C:/absolute/path/to/data/raw
# VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
# Extra Host / Origin values the API's write gate admits (docs/OPERATIONS.md section 1.1); comma-separated, loopback names only.
# STOCK_API_PUBLIC_HOSTS=localhost:8080
# STOCK_API_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5174
